 212 is getting doused by rain. It's the sort of weather that's right for enjoying music at home. Maybe have some tea and gaze at the rain-covered plants. Perhaps you can giggle at people running to avoid the downpour. That's the weather brought to you by Helena!": 5, "It's a Wii! It's controlled by a Wii Remote!": 10, "MC: Here's another story on the cutting edge!": 7, "Researcher: It's the Pokemon Research Corner! Today, we'll examine a wild Pokemon live in the field. Ah, here we go, a wild ROSELIA conveniently just came along... Oh? It's holding something! Let's roll on up and take a look! Hi, there! Can I take a look... Yow! Ouch! It scratched my finger! But OK, we now know that wild ROSELIA have the possibility of holding the item Poison Barb. Thank you, ROSELIA, here's your Poison Barb back... Aiyaaah! Ow, ow, ow! Scratched me again! As usual, I got a Pokemon riled up at me! It's time for me to go! So long!": 1, "Helena: This is Helena bringing you on-the-spot weather! Route 216 is taking cover in a blizzard! Some of you may brave the weather in hopes of finding rare Pokemon under these extreme conditions. Be sure to dress extra warm, and don't fall asleep! That's the weather brought to you by Helena!": 1, "TwistedSpoon": 2, "Researcher: It's the Pokemon Research Corner! Today, we'll examine a wild Pokemon live in the field. Ah, here we go, a wild CLEFAIRY conveniently just came along... Oh? It's holding something! Let's roll on up and take a look! Hi, there! Can I take a look... Yow! Ouch! It scratched my finger! But OK, we now know that wild CLEFAIRY have the possibility of holding the item Moon Stone. Thank you, CLEFAIRY, here's your Moon Stone back... Aiyaaah! Ow, ow, ow! Scratched me again! As usual, I got a Pokemon riled up at me! It's time for me to go! So long!": 2, "MC: Sinnoh Now goes the extra distance to bring you news. We promise to do our best to keep you informed with the news you want! See you again!": 3, "Researcher: It's the Pokemon Research Corner! Today, we'll examine a wild Pokemon live in the field. Ah, here we go, a wild CHANSEY conveniently just came along... Oh? It's holding something! Let's roll on up and take a look! Hi, there! Can I take a look... Yow! Ouch! It scratched my finger! But OK, we now know that wild CHANSEY have the possibility of holding the item Lucky Egg. Thank you, CHANSEY, here's your Lucky Egg back... Aiyaaah! Ow, ow, ow! Scratched me again! As usual, I got a Pokemon riled up at me! It's time for me to go! So long!": 1, "Commercial: Pokemon Center. Always by your side.": 4, "Commercial: The preceding program has been brought to you by Jubilife TV!": 3, "Enzo checked the PC screen. Adventure Rule No. 1 The X Button opens the menu! Adventure Rule No. 2 Record your progress with SAVE. There is nothing else on here...": 2, "Helena: This is Helena bringing you on-the-spot weather! There isn't a cloud in the sky above Route 213! It's the sort of day that's ideal for having your picture taken. Everyone looks prettier under the smiling sun! That's the weather brought to you by Helena!": 1, "Helena: This is Helena bringing you on-the-spot weather! It's nothing but blue skies over Route 213! It would be a shame to spend a day like this cooped up indoors. Why not step outside and bask under the sun? Why not amuse yourself with a solo whistling performance? That's the weather brought to you by Helena!": 2, "Matt's mom: Oh, hi, Enzo. Are you looking for Matt? He was gone for a second, but then he came running right back home. He just can't sit still, that boy. I wonder who he takes after?": 5, "Technology just blows me away! I mean, now you can play with people around the world...wirelessly!": 3, "Enzo's House": 8, "It's true that wild Pokemon do attack people sometimes... However, Pokemon also let you become friends with them.": 4, "Acuity Lakefront": 6, "Matt's House": 12, "This is where Mom does all her delicious cooking.": 4, "Hiya, Enzo. Matt was looking for you. I think he's home now. Why don't you go check it out?": 6, "Saving a lot of data... Don't turn off the power.": 4, "Matt's mom: That kid rocketed off again like usual. I'd guess he would be out on Route 201 by now? He just can't sit still, that boy. I wonder who he takes after?": 12, "Matt's mom: Matt should be out on Route 201 by now. He just can't sit still, that boy. I wonder who he takes after?": 12, "Snowpoint City": 3, "'s mom: That kid rocketed off again like usual. I'd guess he would be out on Route 201 by now? He just can't sit still, that boy. I wonder who he takes after?": 1, "MC: On Battling Trainers, we're always on the hunt for news. Our interviewers have scattered throughout Sinnoh. We look forward to hearing about you, Trainers! That's all the time we have today! Good-bye, and good battling!": 7, "MC: Good evening! Is everyone raising Pokemon? It's time for the Battling Trainers!": 6, "Hiya, Enzo. You're looking for Matt? He just went tearing off a little while ago. He's probably not gone too far. Why not go chase after him?": 7, "Commercial: Pokemon Mart. Where smiling faces gather.": 1, "You're off to hang with Matt again, right? You two sure are tight!": 3, "MC: Pokemon! Battle! Watch! Good evening! Everyone keeping up the good battle? It's time for Pokemon Battle Watch, where we do in-depth analyses of hot-blooded battling Trainers!": 1, "Mom: Bye-bye, Enzo! You take care now!": 2, "MC: Pokemon Battle Watch needs your help! We're always after news about your hot Pokemon battles. We'd also love it if you'd mix records with friends in a Union Room. That way, we can get battle news about your friends, too. Let's meet again here! Battle! Watch!": 1, "Mom: What is it, dear? Isn't Matt waiting for you?": 1, "MC: Here we are! It's the Contest Digest! The winner of today's Normal Rank Smart Contest is... Westley, who won with his bright spark of a Pokemon! That's all the time we have today! Let's meet again!": 3, "Matt: Hey, you saw that news report that was on TV, right? You know, \"Search for the Red GYARADOS! The mysterious appearance of the furious Pokemon in a lake!\" That show got me to thinking. I'll bet our local lake has a Pokemon like that in it, too! So, that's what we're gonna do. We'll go find a Pokemon like that!": 2, "Matt: Hey! Where are you wandering off to?! That mystery Pokemon on TV! It's calling out to me! Forget about going back home!": 6, "Remember what your mother said? Mom: \"Enzo! Don't go into the tall grass! \"Remember, wild Pokemon may attack you if you're walking in tall grass. \"It would be OK if you had your own Pokemon, but...\"": 2, "Rt. 201 Twinleaf Town": 1, "Verity Lakefront": 8, "Matt: All right! To the lake! Let's find us a red GYARADOS!": 8, "Lake Verity Ahead The Lake of Emotions": 62, "Matt: What's going on...?": 8, "Professor, there isn't anything out of the ordinary on the other side, either!": 8, "Professor: Hmm... I may have been mistaken... Something appears to be different than it was before, but... Fine! It's enough that we have seen the lake.": 8, "Dawn, we're leaving.": 8, "Dawn: Professor, how are you enjoying being back in Sinnoh? After being away for four years, it must be exciting again?": 8, "Professor: ...Hm. There is one thing I can say. There are many rare kinds of Pokemon in Sinnoh. The region should serve us very well in regard to our studies.": 8, "Professor: Excuse me. Let us pass, please.": 8, "Dawn: I beg your pardon... We'll be on our way.": 8, "Matt: What was that about? Those two...": 8, "Huh? Enzo! Let's go check this out!": 8, "... ... What's that? Don't go into the tall grass? No problem, no problem! We won't be in there long enough for a wild Pokemon to come out.": 8, "It's... A briefcase? Those people forgot it here. What are we supposed to do with it? We can try to deliver it, but who are they? I heard them say professor...": 8, "Waaah! Po-Pokemon?!": 8, "What's going on?!": 8, "Look! These are Poke Balls! Let's battle using these!": 8, "Eh...? Which one do you want, then?": 8, "came charging!": 4, "Go! TURTWIG!": 1, "Go! CHIMCHAR!": 2, "used Scratch!": 2, "used Tackle!": 3, "used Growl!": 3, "CHIMCHAR's Attack fell!": 1, "The wild STARLY's Attack fell!": 1, "The wild STARLY used Tackle!": 1, "The wild STARLY fainted!": 3, "CHIMCHAR gained 16 Exp. Points!": 2, "TURTWIG's Attack fell!": 1, "Matt: Fwaaah! Your CHIMCHAR totally rocked! But my PIPLUP was way tougher than yours! ...They were other people's Pokemon, though... But we had to use them... They won't mind, will they?": 2, "Dawn: Oh! There's the briefcase! The professor would have been furious if I'd lost it...": 3, "Dawn: Huh? Oh, no! Did you... Did you use the Pokemon in here? You did?! Oh, my gosh! What's the professor going to say...? ...This is so not good... I'll take this briefcase for now.": 3, "I don't know what's going on. Enzo, let's get out of here. My Pokemon got hurt from that battle. If we get attacked by another Pokemon, we might be in trouble.": 3, "Matt: You go ahead... ...I know we have to go return these Pokemon. They're not ours. But I want to spend just a little more time with this little guy...": 23, "TURTWIG gained 16 Exp. Points!": 1, "Matt: Fwaaah! Your TURTWIG totally rocked! But my CHIMCHAR was way tougher than yours! ...They were other people's Pokemon, though... But we had to use them... They won't mind, will they?": 1, "Matt: Hey, hey! Where do you think you're going? We have to go return these Pokemon...": 33, "PIPLUP's Attack fell!": 1, "won't go lower!": 1, "used Pound!": 1, "Matt: We didn't have any choice in using those people's Pokemon, right? But these Pokemon belong to them... They'll want them back, won't they? But this is the first Pokemon I've ever battled with...": 7, "Choose a Pokemon.": 8, "Matt: I wish I could grow tougher with this little guy...": 1, "Do what with CHIMCHAR?": 3, ": You go ahead... ...I know we have to go return these Pokemon. They're not ours. But I want to spend just a little more time with this little guy...": 1, "Matt: Hey, it's those people! Is that old guy staring at us?": 6, "Professor: Hmm... I heard from Dawn that you used our Pokemon? Let me see them, please. Hmm... CHIMCHAR and PIPLUP... ... Hmm... I see... That's how it is...": 6, "Dawn! I'm going back to my lab!": 6, "Dawn: Um... Yes! Professor, please wait for me!": 6, "I think you should visit our lab later. OK, see you!": 6, "Matt: What was all that craziness about? I mean, if he was angry, he could've just yelled at us, or whatever... And didn't he want their Pokemon back...? Enzo... We should go home, too...": 6, "Mom: What's up, dear? ... Wow. I can't believe that happened to you. Am I ever glad that both you and Matt are unharmed. The professor you mentioned is most likely Professor Rowan of Sandgem Town. I've heard that he is well known for his studies on Pokemon. I hear he's also quite intimidating... Enzo, I think you need to visit him in Sandgem Town. You need to properly explain why you had no choice but to use his Pokemon. Don't worry! I'm sure he will understand.": 6, "Oh, I know! Enzo, put these on.": 6, "Going to Sandgem Town is like an adventure in itself, right? With those Running Shoes, you can get to faraway places much faster. OK... Let me read the instructions... \"Press the B Button and dash about faster than ever before! \"Put on the Running Shoes and blaze new trails of adventure!\" Well, isn't that just nifty!": 6, "Twinleaf Town": 4, "Mom: I'll read you the instructions for the Running Shoes... \"Press the B Button and dash about faster than ever before! \"Put on the Running Shoes and blaze new trails of adventure!\" Well, isn't that just nifty!": 1, "I went on an adventure with some Pokemon a long time ago. It was only to the next town, though. Yeah, good times...": 1, "Oh! A Pokemon! You look good together!": 1}, "volatile_flags": [142, 402, 404, 406, 407, 429, 434, 435, 436, 2401]}